{"id":"n64206-2-4","stage":2,"title":"속다 · 误会","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64206-2-4-1","ko":"넌 네 형이랑 정말 닮았구나.","zh":"你和你哥哥真像。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"형이랑","meaning":"哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）","explanation":"형：哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"1","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형이랑","audio":"/audio/4ec92d82b8e9e31df3bd.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"닮았구나.","meaning":"像，随","explanation":"닮다：像，随；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"닮다","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73354","senseId":"1","lemma":"닮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닮았구나","audio":"/audio/d0291906b03c93808dc1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"997d7178d3aa00dd","term":"형","zh":"哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3","entryId":"20286","definition":"男子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["형"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"593cd68a24885987","term":"닮다","zh":"像，随","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3","entryId":"73354","definition":"指两个以上的人或事物拥有相似的长相或属性。","pronunciation":["담ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/70f573edf27cd3b108eb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64206-2-4-2","ko":"네, 그래서 사람들이 저를 형으로 속을 때가 많아요.","zh":"是啊，所以别人经常把我认成我哥哥。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들이","audio":"/audio/42e5b243df0b3ed051af.mp3"}},{"text":"저를","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저를","audio":"/audio/da4de346f30de5013b78.mp3"}},{"text":"형으로","meaning":"哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）","explanation":"형：哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"1","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형으로","audio":"/audio/673f9655c41ce8cfa6c4.mp3"}},{"text":"속을","meaning":"误会","explanation":"속다：误会；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"속다","audio":"/audio/86d9221aa60ec58a79a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64206","senseId":"2","lemma":"속다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"속을","audio":"/audio/b9f2556789370ea8cdd9.mp3"}},{"text":"때가","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때가","audio":"/audio/2794e832ef37e0b9c41c.mp3"}},{"text":"많아요.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아요","audio":"/audio/e2d2cc074c8e28c555ca.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"997d7178d3aa00dd","term":"형","zh":"哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3","entryI